{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "3de7c3cf3a1ef6da773c9439eb525070b2246df45651b53a5c4a0e331b9dde13", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# EXM-03 — What Examiners Reward"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "ea367945887d1bcfc787ca5b33f037399217bc9cece1c9025dfb03cc5c71679d", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues what the official 4CH1 examiner reports single out for\nreward, as held in the corpus of record (SRC-ER-4CH1): well-answered extended\nresponses, strong mathematical work, above-expected calculation performance,\nwell-judged paper balance and preparation that paid. Every claim is carried on a\nbounded, page-located excerpt from the run's evidence pack, with paper/session\nidentity preserved. Research artifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "733279d8847643f8864ec2d079aab827fba2bae1d33a67980878c934d2865d99", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** named well-answered questions; mathematical-skill rewards;\nabove-expectation performance notes; balance/accessibility judgements; preparation\neffects.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-ER-4CH1 (the 2023-06 1C/1CR/2C and 2024-06 2C report excerpts of\nthe pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** warnings (EXM-02) and penalties (EXM-04); mark-scheme-derived\nsentiment (forbidden substitution — rewards here come only from report text)."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "c1a6831f44cd22e8528a59ff3555560e7afe5a18de20c1b9479cc46f2cfbfdfe", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe reports reward in consistent categories. Extended responses are named\nquestion-by-question when they go well; mathematical skills are praised as a\nstrength of the cohort, with graph work, mole calculations and RAM calculations\nsingly cited for full-mark performance; papers are rewarded as well balanced when\nthey carry accessible marks on all questions; and preparation effects are stated\nplainly. For revision design, the reward map is a positive syllabus: the examiners'\nown list of what a cohort did well is the list of what good preparation produces."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "e30a6f53d442d3f60093b3a7b8bc5cf07aa3b43f04e0e7e4ab8743cb6a9a2aae", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-ER-4CH1 — the 2023-06 and 2024-06 examiner-report PDFs of the\npack (page-located excerpts from the commentary zone; per-file identity carried by\nthe paper-dir paths). Paper identity rides on SRC-QPMS-4CH1 per the source\nmanifest's limitation note. No mark schemes were consumed for reward claims; the\nexaminer-sentiment substitution is forbidden and was not made."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "4ef58623446036a8a0ed70424b38abadea5377b992107c6752c6be16a89317f3", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe reward catalogue covers the pack's excerpted reports (2023-06, 2024-06); other\nheld sessions sit in sibling packs. Sessions without public ERs remain source gaps\nof record. No canonical planes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-010", "content_sha256": "a9d39e2787293b39900a6d0377f01d417132cbac981be68193f1278d35df21de", "heading": "EXM-010", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-010", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-010", "text": "### EXM-010 — Extended responses named for quality\n\n**Claim:** reports name the specific extended-response parts that were particularly\nwell answered.\n**Evidence:** \"Some of the extended response questions were particularly well\nanswered\" — the 2023-06 1C introduction praises topic-spanning knowledge (\"In\ngeneral, candidates performed well on this paper and displayed good knowledge across\na range of topic areas.\") (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-011", "content_sha256": "73054c0acfb01086140cd60b316bdf4c0b5a3b29e7b274dfd32de08e317ae756", "heading": "EXM-011", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-011", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-011", "text": "### EXM-011 — Mathematical skills rewarded at full marks\n\n**Claim:** mathematical work (graphs, moles, RAM) is cited for full-mark\nperformance.\n**Evidence:** \"Where mathematical skills were assessed eg in graph plotting, in\nmoles calculations, or in calculating a relative atomic mass, many candidates were\nable to score full marks.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-012", "content_sha256": "c9742202a778b46c078abd04cf167b003ac7a300e1a5eaaac9afd070a320cd70", "heading": "EXM-012", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-012", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-012", "text": "### EXM-012 — Calculations performing above expectation\n\n**Claim:** reports note when calculation performance exceeded their expectation, and\nattribute it.\n**Evidence:** \"The calculations on this paper performed better than expected, which\nwas understandable as overseas candidates often have good mathematical skills...\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3); the 2C sibling repeats the judgement\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-013", "content_sha256": "5d59ce8f57f55759303c106ebf043ccd56fedb69e63ab201ab85dbb46cca5795", "heading": "EXM-013", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-013", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-013", "text": "### EXM-013 — Balance and accessibility rewarded\n\n**Claim:** papers are praised for carrying accessible marks across all questions.\n**Evidence:** \"The paper was well balanced, with accessible marks on all questions.\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3); \"well balanced with some accessible marks\non all questions\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-014", "content_sha256": "0150e6661e5d2b014b6a2a7a25ca241024cf01f3a16920a69016a3487f15005d", "heading": "EXM-014", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-014", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-014", "text": "### EXM-014 — Performance beyond expectation on novel formats\n\n**Claim:** examiners reward cohorts that handle unfamiliar formats well.\n**Evidence:** the 2024-06 2C introduction on the unusual double-curve graph —\n\"However many candidates did surprisingly well in this question with quite a few\ngaining all ten marks.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2024-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "chunk_id": "EXM-03:rec:EXM-015", "content_sha256": "285970100983d9d8b7ccbf60f8a4339e539cd3ec9545d6eb78818ee3eb0e6f64", "heading": "EXM-015", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-015", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-015", "text": "### EXM-015 — Discrimination praised when fair\n\n**Claim:** reports reward papers that discriminate while staying fair across grades.\n**Evidence:** \"This paper discriminated well and gave a range of marks over all\ngrades.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3); \"This paper discriminated well\ngiving a range of marks for all grades.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
